body:
Hello, how can I pass in the corresponding key through a command for something like this with env


`{
    "mcpServers": {
        "baidu-maps": {
            "command": "uvx",
            "args": [
                "mcp-server-baidu-maps"
            ],
            "env": {
                "BAIDU_MAPS_API_KEY": "xxx"
            }
        }
    }
}`

Is that so?

```shell
uvx mcpo --port 8000 -- uvx mcp-server-baidu-maps --BAIDU_MAPS_API_KEY=xxxx
```
